WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.080
“We should catch up” needs a date.

2
00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:06.160
Otherwise, you can both keep saying “definitely”

3
00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.780
until October becomes next October.

4
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.180
Try: “Want to grab coffee Saturday?”

5
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:13.780
I'm free around 11.

6
00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.620
Actually, give them an easy alternative.

7
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.480
If Saturday doesn't work, what works for you?

8
00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:22.520
There, an invitation they can answer.

9
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.800
Send this to the friend you've been meaning to see.
